[Messages]
WelcomeLabel1=Welcome to A500 Launcher
WelcomeLabel2=This will install A500 Launcher on your computer.%n%nA500 Launcher is a Workbench-style front end dedicated to Amiga 500 emulation. WinUAE 6.0.3 is bundled; you supply your own Kickstart ROM and disk images.%n%nWindows 11 is required.
ClickNext=Insert disk and press Next to continue.
FinishedHeadingLabel=A500 Launcher is ready
FinishedLabelNoIcons=A500 Launcher has been installed.
FinishedLabel=A500 Launcher has been installed. Drop your Kickstart ROM in the bios folder and your .adf files in the roms folder, then start the Amiga 500.
